WEBVTT

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:31.290
Her oldest son joined
an anti-Taliban militia unit,

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.000
another joined the Taliban,

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.711
and her two youngest
were recruited by the army.

00:03:36.879 --> 00:03:40.633
Here she is revealing an open
wound on her throat,

00:03:40.675 --> 00:03:43.928
a wound that doctors believe
is caused by grief.

00:03:45.388 --> 00:03:48.808
During my visit to Afghanistan's
National Institute of Music,

00:03:48.808 --> 00:03:52.144
the first and only music
school in Afghanistan,

00:03:52.186 --> 00:03:54.730
I met 17-year-old Sumbul,

00:03:54.772 --> 00:03:56.482
a brilliant violinist.

00:03:56.941 --> 00:03:59.360
She is the symbol of this generation

00:03:59.402 --> 00:04:02.321
that came of age with relative freedom